# Keep the generated laser and CAD files byte-stable on every platform.
#
# These DXFs are validated by byte comparison and by XOR against their masters,
# and the documentation states they are byte-identical to what the tools emit.
# Letting git rewrite line endings on checkout would silently break that, so the
# text formats are pinned to LF rather than left to core.autocrlf.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.dxf  text eol=lf
*.svg  text eol=lf
*.step text eol=lf
*.scad text eol=lf
*.csv  text eol=lf

*.stl binary
*.f3d binary
*.zip binary
